WEBVTT

00:07:29.396 --> 00:07:30.476
Ayurveda,

00:07:30.476 --> 00:07:31.636
Chinese,

00:07:31.636 --> 00:07:33.036
Greco-Islamic,

00:07:33.036 --> 00:07:35.076
as well as Indigenous healing knowledge,

00:07:35.076 --> 00:07:37.916
understood bodies through one’s life force

00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:42.156
and the energy in connection
to natural and social environment.

00:07:43.076 --> 00:07:45.836
Energetic qualities of bodies
such as dosha,

00:07:45.836 --> 00:07:46.836
chi

00:07:46.836 --> 00:07:49.156
or vital essences such as blood,

00:07:49.156 --> 00:07:51.996
are much more significant
than external features.

00:07:52.836 --> 00:07:56.236
The outside body was a reflection
of one’s interior

00:07:56.236 --> 00:08:00.276
to understand what was happening
inside for health and balance.